Package: eglrun
Version: 2.0.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: bash, coreutils
Maintainer: WorkBuddy <workbuddy@localhost>
Description: GPU launcher for Chrome and Electron on Maleoon 910 (X11+Vulkan, VAAPI)
 eglrun launches a Chrome or Electron app on HUAWEI Kirin 9000c / Maleoon 910
 (UOS 20) over X11 with ANGLE-Vulkan and an ICD wrapper for true GPU WebGL2 and
 dma-buf hardware compositing, plus a VAAPI shim that restores hardware decode.
